### 2026-07-02 - mlx-qwen27-noctx-vote

- Run ID: `mlx-qwen27-noctx-vote`
- Code path / command:
  - `uv pip install --python .venv/bin/python mlx-lm`
  - `python scripts/mlx_qwen_judge.py eval --model qwen35_9b --rows no_context --variant strict --variant lenient --variant noctx_fact`
  - `python scripts/mlx_qwen_judge.py eval --model qwen36_27b --rows no_context --variant noctx_fact`
