  - `python scripts/mlx_qwen_judge.py predict --model qwen36_27b --rows no_context --variant noctx_fact --variant strict --variant exam_strict --variant zero_bias`
- Models / features:
  - Local LM Studio MLX model `Qwen3.6-27B-MLX-4bit`
  - Four no-context judge variants: `noctx_fact`, `strict`, `exam_strict`, `zero_bias`
